{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aDreams Boundary\u300bis a roguelike card game where you must construct your card deck at the start of each run before embarking on your adventure. The combat system consists of a Preparation Phase and an Action Phase. Cards you play do not take effect immediately, but generate intents similar to enemies. During the Action Phase, both you and enemies will execute prepared actions in sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/Title001.png?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Select the cards to play this turn and press the action button - the battle will commence immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/001.gif?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/Title002.png?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Freely explore the map and visit locations of interest. Note: With limited movement chances, plan your route for maximum rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/002.gif?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/Title003.png?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gain XP to level up. Each level-up lets you choose a talent to enhance your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/003.gif?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/Title004.png?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Collect powerful relics to aid your journey. Gather specific quantities to activate ultimate effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/004.gif?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/Title005.png?t=1740463714\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Encounter random events and negotiate with shady merchants - but do you really need what they offer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/005.gif?t=1740463714\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541180?t=1740463714","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541180?t=1740463714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/ea76623afcf4e347ae140423e8db0fee1bbb1245/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740463714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/ea76623afcf4e347ae140423e8db0fee1bbb1245/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740463714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3543590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aDreams Boundary\u300bis a roguelike card game where you must construct your card deck at the start of each run before embarking on your adventure. The combat system consists of a Preparation Phase and an Action Phase. Cards you play do not take effect immediately, but generate intents similar to enemies. During the Action Phase, both you and enemies will execute prepared actions in sequence.</p>